  <p id="c-nanshi-016-fangshuan-changyu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">帝歎曰：「<persName id="c-nanshi-016-fangshuan-changyu:p001:m0005" ref="5ql_hfz_086">叔安</persName>節義，古人中求之耳，恨不至方伯而終。」子<persName id="c-nanshi-016-fangshuan-changyu:p001:m0027" ref="5ql_hfz_086_A">長瑜</persName>，亦有義行，永明中，爲州中從事。</p>
